    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Community server</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390520/extras/a41a63ef349c3cd0384240dc6c07514d.avif?t=1755084718\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390520/extras/6a69445c12c321bf4f89dad25696e5a4.avif?t=1755084718\" data-has-big width=800 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Experience </strong>a<strong> musical pacifist adventure</strong> much more focused on <strong>emotions</strong> and <strong>characters</strong> rather than fighting and action. (Beware of the &quot;friendly-looking angels&quot;, nonetheless!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to <strong>listen</strong> to a <strong>rich soundtrack</strong> and <strong>play exciting music-themed mini games</strong>, <strong>turn-based bosses</strong> and more! (Some of them are really challenging.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel the world</strong> and get to <strong>save it</strong> through an <strong>original story</strong> and <strong>deep lore</strong> with glimpses of <strong>humor</strong>! (I've heard the dads and moms' stories are neat...)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No one gets hurt</strong>. You'll have to use something <strong>other than violence</strong> in order to <strong>solve conflicts</strong>. (Maybe use your brain? Or your heart?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices matter</strong>! Whenever a decision is presented to you, <strong>choose carefully</strong>! It may <strong>impact the story</strong> and how other <strong>characters feel about you</strong>. (It may also impact how you feel about yourself, huh.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Promote nature and animal protection everywhere</strong>. Even if you gotta <strong>fight for it</strong>! (*ahem* Fighting as defending it. Never forget about the fourth feature. NEVER.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>feed pigeons</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390520/extras/646f93de1bcf32d74442ec097fa38691.poster.avif?t=1755084718\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390520/extras/646f93de1bcf32d74442ec097fa38691.webm?t=1755084718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390520/extras/72467f3f9fdb769275ccc049ca519eac.avif?t=1755084718\" data-has-big width=800 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong>, talk to <strong>NPCs</strong> and <strong>find gems</strong> in overworld then <strong>trade</strong> them for delicious healthy snacks which you can later use to brighten your mood up during <strong>fights</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also <strong>trade</strong> gems for <strong>gears</strong> that could provide nice <strong>advantage</strong> facing <strong>bosses</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way into <strong>boss fights</strong> <strong>peacefully</strong> by using your <strong>words</strong>. You should be able to <strong>convince</strong> and <strong>change their mind</strong> if you choose the correct ones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some <strong>angels</strong> aren't much up for <strong>conversations</strong>! They will let you know by <strong>attacking</strong>. Don't get <strong>hit</strong> <strong>too much</strong> or you might run out of <strong>motivation</strong> to continue.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIP</strong> stands for <strong>Mind Points</strong> and <strong>MOP</strong> stands for <strong>Mood Points</strong>. These work like the <strong>HP</strong> of the <strong>player</strong> and the <strong>boss</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390520/extras/d97713e929f3b052a15b1166878cf698.avif?t=1755084718\" data-has-big width=800 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390520/extras/ddcf642680f2e562e7f5756edaa4a808.avif?t=1755084718\" data-has-big width=800 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390520/extras/331024a27394f6f439fd313748b072d2.avif?t=1755084718\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390520/extras/0a22900d879183fdf34d785f53825eff.avif?t=1755084718\" data-has-big width=800 height=367 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FYI:\u00a0 In-game, choices matter. However, there's no &quot;bad choices&quot; in Word To Angel. Feel free to choose however you want and don't be worried that the story will become shorter or less interesting if you choose this or that. It won't be the case.</i></p>",
